TrackMe 1.8.6 — clearer progress and more truthful route previews.

• Home now shows active duration across four weeks and a typed distance breakdown for every activity used this week.
• My Progress adds six local-only levels and activity milestones, with no account, cloud or social ranking required.
• Auto-pauses render as circles while manual or unknown route gaps remain dotted.
• Ride detail, share preview and exported images now use the same route geometry and framing.
